Update 2026-07-22 (late): the direct-init failure is now SILENT --
`optionalish o(e);` and every following statement of main are dropped
from the goto program (0 properties, vacuous VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL)
instead of reporting "found no match".  The desc's assertion-line
pattern catches the vacuousness.  Statement-level error recovery
swallowing a failing declaration without a diagnostic is itself a
defect to fix alongside the resolution failure.
